  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be always true then the given statement&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be a tautology.</p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be true,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi></math>&nbsp;should be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
